        <p class="text-sm text-amber-200/90 leading-relaxed">
          Panipat is celebrated across the globe as India's premier historic textile capital. Every Teepul drapery is precision-woven in our family-managed facilities using high-GSM jacquard and heavy polyester yarns. By shipping directly to your doorstep, we eliminate distributors, showroom rents, and retail markups — offering bespoke luxury at honest direct-from-mill value.
