          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ <strong>Dispatch:</strong> Guaranteed within 24–48 hours across India</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ <strong>Payments:</strong> 256-bit encrypted Razorpay & Paytm Gateway</li>
